stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NeedRecorded
  NeedRecorded --> Reused: existing qualified agent/skill fits
  NeedRecorded --> Candidate: documented gap
  Candidate --> IsolatedEvaluation
  IsolatedEvaluation --> Rework: criteria not met
  Rework --> Candidate: new version
  IsolatedEvaluation --> Qualified: distinct reviewer + fixed checks
  Qualified --> Active: trusted gate + scoped grant
  Active --> Dormant: no current task
  Dormant --> Active: still qualified
  Active --> Blocked: revoked qualification or integrity hold
  Active --> Candidate: proposed new version
  Blocked --> Archived
  Archived --> [*]
